{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4c4b1e52",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 04. 前処理：マスキング + Sudachi分かち書き\n",
    [![Open In Colab](https://colab.research.google.com/assets/colab-badge.svg)](https://colab.research.google.com/github/nishidaab26002-arch/-/blob/main/programs/04_preprocess_tokenize.ipynb),
    "\n",
    "口コミ本文を**学習用のトークン列**に変換し、CSVとして保存します（入力: 03の出力 → 出力: `reviews_tokenized.csv`）。\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "reviews_with_water_hardness.csv ─▶ 地名・「〇〇らしい」を除去(mask) ─▶ Sudachiで分かち書き ─▶ reviews_tokenized.csv\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "処理の中身は共通モジュール `sake_nlp.py`（`mask_review` / `tokenize`）にあります。\n",
    "学習(05)と新規銘柄の推論(06)で**同じ前処理**を使うため、関数を1か所にまとめています。\n",
    "\n",
    "| 処理 | 目的 |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| マスキング | 都道府県名・「新潟らしい」等を除去し、**地名で味わいを判断するバイアス**を防ぐ |\n",
    "| Sudachi (SplitMode.C, 正規化形) | 表記ゆれ（旨み/旨味 等）を統一 |\n",
    "| 日本酒用語の再結合 | 「無濾過」「生酛」など分割されやすい語を1語に戻す |\n",
    "| 品詞・ストップワード・2文字未満の除外 | 味わいに関係しない語を除く |"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "2f71c847",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 依存ライブラリのインストール（Colab）\n",
    "!pip install -q sudachipy sudachidict-full pandas"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "dbdeb9e1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 設定"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "6fa70c9a",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# --- 実行環境の設定 ---------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "# Colab: Google Driveをマウントし、BASE_DIR 配下を読み書きします。\n",
    "# ローカル: 環境変数 SAKE_PROJECT_DIR でデータ置き場を指定できます。\n",
    "import os, sys\n",
    "\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    from google.colab import drive\n",
    "    drive.mount('/content/drive')\n",
    "    BASE_DIR = '/content/drive/MyDrive/作成したプログラム等/日本酒口コミ分析'  # 自分のDriveのパスに変更\n",
    "    # sake_nlp.py をDriveの BASE_DIR 直下に置くか、Colabの左ペインにアップロードしてください\n",
    "    sys.path.append(BASE_DIR)\n",
    "except ImportError:\n",
    "    BASE_DIR = os.environ.get('SAKE_PROJECT_DIR', './sake_review_analysis')\n",
    "\n",
    "CSV_DIR = f'{BASE_DIR}/口コミ_CSV'          # 収集・加工したCSV\n",
    "MODEL_DIR = f'{BASE_DIR}/機械学習モデル'      # 学習済みDoc2Vecモデル\n",
    "for d in (CSV_DIR, MODEL_DIR):\n",
    "    os.makedirs(d, exist_ok=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "REVIEWS_CSV = f'{CSV_DIR}/reviews_with_water_hardness.csv'   # 03で作成した口コミ+硬度\n",
    "TOKENIZED_CSV = f'{CSV_DIR}/reviews_tokenized.csv'           # 04の出力 = 05, 06の入力\n",
    "MODEL_PATH = f'{MODEL_DIR}/final_masked_sudachi_doc2vec.model'  # 05の出力 = 06の入力\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "bf320efb",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. データ読み込み"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "1b916959",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import sake_nlp as nlp\n",
    "\n",
    "df = pd.read_csv(REVIEWS_CSV, encoding='utf-8-sig')\n",
    "df = df.dropna(subset=['review_body']).reset_index(drop=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 銘柄タグ = 都道府県_銘柄_蔵元（Doc2Vecで「1銘柄=1ベクトル」を学習するためのラベル）\n",
    "df['tag'] = df['prefecture'] + '_' + df['brand'] + '_' + df['maker']\n",
    "print(f'口コミ件数: {len(df)} / 銘柄数: {df[\"tag\"].nunique()}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "158e575d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. マスキング（効果の確認）"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "f4510f8d",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df['review_masked'] = df['review_body'].apply(nlp.mask_review)\n",
    "\n",
    "samples = df[df['review_body'].str.contains('北海道|新潟|岡山|灘|伏見', na=False)].head(3)\n",
    "for _, row in samples.iterrows():\n",
    "    print('【元】', row['review_body'][:100])\n",
    "    print('【後】', row['review_masked'][:100], '\\n')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "260385c3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. 分かち書き"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "a0703508",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 動作確認\n",
    "for text in ['無濾過生原酒で旨味があってまろやか', '山廃仕込みで酸味が強い', '生酛造りの純米吟醸']:\n",
    "    print(text, '→', nlp.tokenize(text))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "45b2df77",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df['tokens'] = df['review_masked'].apply(nlp.tokenize)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 3語未満の口コミは文書として短すぎるため除外\n",
    "MIN_TOKENS = 3\n",
    "before = len(df)\n",
    "df = df[df['tokens'].str.len() >= MIN_TOKENS].reset_index(drop=True)\n",
    "print(f'除外: {before - len(df)}件 → 残り {len(df)}件 / 銘柄数 {df[\"tag\"].nunique()}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1bee3e77",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. 語彙の確認"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "e0f0ca15",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from collections import Counter\n",
    "\n",
    "counter = Counter(w for toks in df['tokens'] for w in toks)\n",
    "print('頻出語 TOP30:')\n",
    "print(pd.DataFrame(counter.most_common(30), columns=['語', '出現回数']).to_string(index=False))\n",
    "\n",
    "important = ['旨味', '酸味', '甘口', '辛口', '山廃', '生酛', 'フルーティー', 'リンゴ', 'メロン', 'キレ', 'コク', 'まろやか']\n",
    "print('\\n重要語の出現回数:', {w: counter.get(w, 0) for w in important})"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e9f361a2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. 保存\n",
    "\n",
    "トークンは半角スペース区切りの文字列にして保存します（05, 06 は `sake_nlp.load_tokenized` で読み込み）。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "37f5d613",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "out = df[['tag', 'prefecture', 'brand', 'maker', 'review_masked']].copy()\n",
    "out['tokens'] = df['tokens'].str.join(' ')\n",
    "out.to_csv(TOKENIZED_CSV, index=False, encoding='utf-8-sig')\n",
    "print(f'✅ 保存: {TOKENIZED_CSV} ({len(out)}行)')"
   ]
  }
 ],
